# Canonical CODEOWNERS for brettdavies/* repos.
# Pairs with the ruleset's `require_code_owner_review: true` parameter:
# the ruleset only enforces "a code owner approved" when a touched file
# matches a path here. Without coverage on a path, the rule is bypassed
# for that path.

# --- Governance: what ships and how ---
scripts/**              @brettdavies
.github/workflows/**    @brettdavies
.github/rulesets/**     @brettdavies
.github/CODEOWNERS      @brettdavies

# --- Release integrity: drives every future cut ---
cliff.toml              @brettdavies

# --- Legal hygiene: never edit without deliberate review ---
LICENSE-*               @brettdavies

# --- Workflow docs: drift between docs and rulesets is a failure mode ---
RELEASES.md             @brettdavies
AGENTS.md               @brettdavies

# --- Optional extensions for repos accepting outside contributions ---
# Uncomment the lines you want covered.
#
# evals/**              @brettdavies
# tests/**              @brettdavies
# fixtures/**           @brettdavies
# .markdownlint-cli2.yaml @brettdavies
